<title>FRANCE: CGIP to keep Cap stake or sell all-radio.</title>
<headline>CGIP to keep Cap stake or sell all-radio.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ernest-Antoine Seilliere, chairman of the CGIP holding company, said in a radio interview that the company would either keep its remaining 20 percent stake in Cap Gemini, or sell all.</p>
<p>&quot;Our stake will not be reduced ... or we would sell it entirely,&quot; he told BFM radio on Friday.</p>
<p>CGIP on Wednesday sold about four percent in information technology company Cap Gemini to institutional investors by means of a placement.</p>
</text>
